  "description": "**Enquiries strictly by email only — applications must be accompanied with up-to-date references, and ID to info@griffinauctioneers.com**\n\nThis beautifully presented two-bedroom bungalow is ideally situated within a small development, just a short stroll from Tramore’s magnificent beach and promenade.\n\nThe accommodation comprises of a bright living room with integrated TV and electric fire. A galley style fitted kitchen, which includes modern appliances and a dining area. Both bedrooms have double beds, with an additional single bed in the larger room.\nProperties to rent in this coastal setting are a rare find, offering the charm of seaside living with all the essentials close at hand. Vibrant cafés, restaurants, shops and leisure facilities are all within walking distance, making it an ideal base for enjoying everything Tramore has to offer.\n\nAdditional features include efficient oil-fired central heating and double-glazed windows throughout.\n\nThe accommodation comes fully furnished and is available to rent immediately\n\n",
